    "description": {
      "value": "<ul>\n<li><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> <em>Unarmored</em> <strong>AC</strong> ≥ 14+</li>\n</ul>\n<p>The rival style to the Turtle School focusing on defense. Fills their ranks by  targeting the naturally gifted.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>You gain +1 to your <strong>AC</strong> so long as you are not <em>Surprised.</em></li>\n<li>Once per <em>Short Rest</em> you may <strong>Block</strong> or <strong>Wild Sense</strong> without expending <strong>Stamina</strong>.</li>\n<li>You gain a 10 foot <em>Fly Speed</em> or increase your current <em>Fly Speed</em> by 10 feet.</li>\n</ul>\n",
